{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/gtxjntdyoxoz2z4ipdrk826qgye8l8i.mp3","text":"博士，我已经按您的要求，将源石和其他矿物甄别分拣完毕了，还有别的需求吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/luruta3rhul3xtuonnyz3wsnw5epqcu.mp3","text":"矿石病真麻烦啊，我现在，就连行动都会被凯尔希医生限制。寿命会被矿石病削减？不，这个倒无所谓啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/3gggioz40yd1pkpoo2o16xx2r6dfyh5.mp3","text":"这把音叉？是魔杖。它不仅是武器，也是用在地质勘探上的工具，用起来十分顺手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/h9x85n8djuqq7u9fo6obz94k5mvir23.mp3","text":"没有遇见罗德岛的话，我可能还在全职从事地质研究的工作。但没遇见你们的话，我可能也已经没命了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/miijtg75vl84i9t28ao6gn42x3ndt71.mp3","text":"啊？我有黑眼圈了？讨厌，我就知道......","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/i8koosur3rt6yj36jl3w2umrjk313qn.mp3","text":"我背后的是什么？这是......算了，解释起来会很麻烦，等有时间再说吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/1ivllmx4vhfrp00q4jf7w0tzk2o2yc1.mp3","text":"有些石头是会跟我说话的，絮絮叨叨，相互争吵不休，把我弄到失眠......你以为我在开玩笑？我难道像是在开玩笑的样子吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/itirbodof1gzqrccj9layayn0j0nk7t.mp3","text":"普罗旺斯还是一如既往的神经大条，再不注意，她可就要变成我这样的重症感染者了。你们最好也多和她说说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/kcryxn3ztt7n0yot5u4gqr2y6k20r9o.mp3","text":"就是这个，就是这个！你看，你看......至少距今三十五万年的地壳挤压，才会形成这种截面！太棒了......博士，知道吗，那些一直以来反驳这项理论的人才是愚昧的......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/2u6v8qfd8bp35b7gv7mxi2o7kiog7x0.mp3","text":"博士......哎，是不是工作得太疲惫了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/me5nfbefz74otzndx7tgb75m880t6sp.mp3","text":"地灵，地质学者兼术师，向你报到。我每天的工作时间是八小时，如果加班的话要额外支付加班费。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/i0r5le3biuvqb549yiy3jwn5usv87be.mp3","text":"嗯，这是学术资料还是别的什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/de7ul35dzdfykat8tca4fj40ccdn3eo.mp3","text":"科研方法也有不断精进的必要呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/9ui0knbmka8frbqq7y2c3vlydecrdgk.mp3","text":"冒昧提醒一下，我只拿一份薪水。不加薪的话，就算升职，我也不会做更多的工作哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/8s1e4oju9hd1c4i7jhgnhmszzjt8kvb.mp3","text":"知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/olwm1uup28ssgm3l85im4xm72b6hql3.mp3","text":"希望这会是一支能应付各种极端环境的小队。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/d6k9bcee7jmzaxjr2cdh2ldg91wi74y.mp3","text":"放心吧，我们很快就能回来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/hj83q3c0lh1ufo2urtry6h3wvtbgoyj.mp3","text":"不能让他们再这样滥用源石。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/huwh5toma7ncgppinw4kgd0fvfv25p9.mp3","text":"在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/bp2ezi4as1i3hznnvuved8jzzaempd6.mp3","text":"作战计划是？","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/kjoe3ce18ez4k7eoqrpikbrrz84two5.mp3","text":"准备完毕。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/2038h7vhg3labvd9envwvxwo1x2q3he.mp3","text":"敌人在哪里？","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/cmp8vsw97p82mwt1bcwpj3yas1zxxb7.mp3","text":"陷下去吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/bm1diod68t556cn1sji22rbs0w59fxe.mp3","text":"大地的力量......","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/gfzodrh9s94ivzngity9waajtvftotl.mp3","text":"到此为止了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/56/r2pbn7xtfcmmjg0ig7e08v1tbck66sr.mp3","text":"你不该踏足这里！","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/aym8b96mxfku75rfi94tvs7ira2j7ym.mp3","text":"敌人的这种行为，只会招致灾难。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/5u5a9ln7pyocq8a0oyeh286q22cgwrn.mp3","text":"所有敌人都处理完毕了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/k9hjdmbyde9ld8f0lkevd1f60pug96c.mp3","text":"是一场不错的胜利呢，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/hwu2hgnsdgbl8y4podcs3kuz4pgxfpb.mp3","text":"怎么会这样......","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/g4c6wdszcp4eraxq1ty3x4o207624b9.mp3","text":"这样的环境，挺适合研究的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/4vh0escki3phijler1g7i2oje7wyvxc.mp3","text":"唔......","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/98akyk2lqe68qrhemewq48ncwit89hc.mp3","text":"这块矿石......给我的？真的可以吗......这......很贵重啊？","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/ee5am63dnh4oi50ljiks1h41d1adqfx.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/2i7j33iotalamj42i2wkz7z0o9cinym.mp3","text":"看看我们脚下宽广的岩层，你觉得它们会在意新年吗？嗯，所以我也不在意。今天对我来说就是普通的休息日而已，所有任务都会被算入加班内容，包括参加晚会。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/tfla8qetzlaof6l4y20v4scjdx3amuo.mp3","text":"博士，该工作了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_183_skgoat/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/qvdotvo8pk3ekhfnyyrw80gj28pyltd.mp3","text":"博士，我已经按您的要求，将源石和其他矿物甄别分拣完毕了，还有别的需求吗？","alt":"voice/char_183_skgoat/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/g5402iajh0dp7bvx1ao2ya97h7mle70.mp3","text":"矿石病真麻烦啊，我现在，就连行动都会被凯尔希医生限制。寿命会被矿石病削减？不，这个倒无所谓啦。","alt":"voice/char_183_skgoat/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/a59hjjghif2ioa5crb5r1ezfe9aj3f8.mp3","text":"这把音叉？是魔杖。它不仅是武器，也是用在地质勘探上的工具，用起来十分顺手。","alt":"voice/char_183_skgoat/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/2u0yoxk8lrp3tfo766ue1odhxbo3vcy.mp3","text":"没有遇见罗德岛的话，我可能还在全职从事地质研究的工作。但没遇见你们的话，我可能也已经没命了。","alt":"voice/char_183_skgoat/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/7ao1uug94nb4hio3hmf2qlemjcbqc4n.mp3","text":"啊？我有黑眼圈了？讨厌，我就知道......","alt":"voice/char_183_skgoat/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/cpighhm4by7lxag0cr7j5pjg8rllwq3.mp3","text":"我背后的是什么？这是......算了，解释起来会很麻烦，等有时间再说吧。","alt":"voice/char_183_skgoat/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/8jf64vg5bh4dv57c4s3zu